            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Oatmeal-Linen-Cloud-Bed-Winston.jpg",
            "title": "Cloud-like Memory Foam with Cooling Gel",
            "text": "<p>The mattress features layers of CertiPUR-US® certified orthopedic foam and cooling gel memory foam, providing multi-layered support, cloud-like comfort, and enhanced breathability—ideal for small to medium dogs.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "text_block_MRNNDQ": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cloud_Bed_-_Sleep_Cloud-2.jpg",
            "title": "Contouring Chin Rest Pillow",
            "text": "<p>Unlike high, firm bolster beds, our soft, low-profile pillow provides gentle support for small to medium dogs. It encourages better posture and restful sleep, allowing your dog to sink in comfortably without straining their neck.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "button_size": "btn--small",
            "video_link_popup": "",
            "video_link_color": "text-dark"
          }
        },
        "text_block_3wMR4M": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Red_clay_linen_cloud_sofa_dog_bed.jpg",
            "title": "Innovative Half-Bolster Design",
            "text": "<p>The half-bolster sofa bed design maximises flat bed space, allowing dogs to stretch out naturally—unlike traditional full-bolster beds. It ensures easier access for smaller dogs and reduces the bulky bolster look, offering a sleek, minimalist aesthetic.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_color": "btn--black",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
