          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cloudbedsmalloatmeallinen_1.jpg",
            "title": "Your dog's forever bed",
            "text": "<p>The Koozi Cloud Bed isn’t just a bed—it’s your dog’s forever bed. With lasting comfort and durability, it provides a soft, supportive retreat for puppies and seniors alike, offering comfort that stands the test of time.</p>",
