    "tabs": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "acordion-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I care for my dog's Cloud Dog bed?",
            "text": "<p>Caring for your Cloud Dog Bed is simple!</p><ol><li><strong>Linen Cover:</strong> The zip-off cover can be easily removed and machine washed on a cold, gentle cycle with mild detergent. For best results, lay flat to dry. Remember to remove the memory foam bolster using the internal zipper.</li><li><strong>Waterproof Liner:</strong> Wipe down the waterproof liner with a spray or soapy water for easy cleaning.</li><li><strong>Foam Core:</strong> If you need to clean the foam, wipe it down with warm, soapy water. Allow it to dry completely in a dry place to ensure all moisture is removed before reassembling the bed.</li></ol><p>By following these care instructions, you can keep your Cloud Dog Bed looking and feeling fresh!</p>"
          }
        },
        "acordion-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the Cloud Dog Bed Suitable for all Dog Breeds?",
            "text": "<p>The bed accommodates all dog breeds, from extra small to large, particularly if they prefer a softer feel rather than a firm hard feel. The mattress is specifically designed with softer memory foam and a lower-profile construction to cater to the comfort needs of small to medium breeds.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_yAjhWr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Warranty and returns",
            "text": "<h4>Returns and Exchanges</h4><p><strong>For Unopened & Unused Items Only</strong><br/>Unopened and unused beds can be returned within 7 days of receipt for a full refund or exchange. Please ensure you have not cut the vacuum seal. To check the size, carefully open the box and unroll the vacuum-sealed item without breaking the seal. If it’s not the right fit, re-roll the item, place it back in the box, and return it.</p><p>You are responsible for the cost and arrangement of return shipping.<br/><br/>Please be aware that opened beds (i.e., those with a cut vacuum seal) cannot be returned or exchanged due to handling difficulties and hygiene concerns.<br/></p><h5>Warranty</h5><p>We offer a 12-month warranty covering manufacturing defects, including faulty workmanship or materials. This warranty does not cover normal wear and tear or damages caused by dog use, such as excessive scratching, biting, accidents, chewing, or other use.</p><p>For warranty issues, please contact us within 48 hours of opening the bed at <a>hello@koozipets.com.au</a>, including images of the defective or damaged item. Failure to provide this information within the specified timeframe may void your exchange or refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d0defd0d-94c3-403c-bd36-dc2f140a104f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I assemble the Cloud Dog bed?",
            "text": "<p>No assembly is required. Once you unbox your dog's new Cloud Bed, it will expand. Your dog can use it immediately. but it will take up to 24 hours for the mattress to completely expand.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_P9GLEx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is CertiPUR-US® Certification?",
            "text": "<p>CertiPUR-US® certified foam ensures that the foam is free from harmful chemicals and substances. Specifically, it means the foam is made without:</p><ul><li>Ozone depleters</li><li>PBDEs (Polybrominated diphenyl ethers) and certain Tris flame retardants (TCEP, TDBPP, TDCPP, TEPA)</li><li>Mercury, lead, and other heavy metals</li><li>Formaldehyde</li><li>Phthalates </li></ul><p>Additionally, CertiPUR-US® foam undergoes rigorous testing to ensure its performance, durability, emissions, and content, with analysis conducted by independent accredited laboratories. This certification helps guarantee a safer and more environmentally friendly foam product.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_zVrFAa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does OEKO-TEX Standard 100 mean?",
            "text": "<p>OEKO-TEX Standard 100 is a certification that ensures our linen covers and foam mattresses are free from harmful substances and chemicals, making them safe for both pets and humans.<br/><br/>This certification guarantees that the fabric meets strict safety and environmental criteria, reflecting our commitment to quality and sustainability. By choosing OEKO-TEX certified covers, you can trust that you are providing a safe, durable, and sustainable option for your dog.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
